or="/document/90/18852/dfas8770tb/"></a><strong>Таблица № 2</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 26%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18852/bssPhr1305/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1305" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1305"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18852/dfasxx15wc/"></a>&#160;</td><td colspan="3" style="width: 73%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18852/bssPhr1306/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1306" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1306"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18852/dfasqeeywh/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="4" style="width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18852/bssPhr1307/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1307" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1307"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18852/dfascodx1x/"></a><strong>Ставки земельного налога, взимаемого за богарные пашни, залежи и многолетние насаждения</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 26%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18852/bssPhr1308/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1308" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1308"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18852/dfas1o2r6u/"></a>&#160;</td><td colspan="3" style="width: 73%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18852/bssPhr1309/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1309" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1309"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18852/dfasbwbwz2/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBotto